SUMMARY:[Time Series & Sequential Data][Data Mining & Data Science] AALTD 2
 026 - Abstract submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Workshop on Advanced Analytics and Learning o
 n Temporal Data\nWebsite: https://ecml-aaltd.github.io/aaltd2026/\nSource
  URL: https://ecml-aaltd.github.io/aaltd2026/dates.html\nLocation: Naples
 \, Italy\nTopics: Time Series & Sequential Data\, Data Mining & Data Scie
 nce\, Machine Learning\, Explainability & Interpretability\nSize: S\nSubm
 ission type: Workshop / paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked 
 date: 2026-10-28\nNotes: Official AALTD 2026 pages confirm the Sep 11 Nap
 les workshop and Jun 5 abstract/Jun 12 paper deadlines (23:59 Pacific Tim
 e)\; the Aug 17 camera-ready gives no hour (end of day PT provisional). A
 s of 2026-10-28 no AALTD 2027 is announced\; ECML PKDD 2027 (Eindhoven\, 
 Aug 30-Sep 3) lists no workshops yet.\nScope: Analytics and learning spec
 ifically for temporal data: time-series classification\, clustering\, for
 ecasting\, segmentation\, anomaly detection\, temporal representations\, 
 and metric or kernel learning. Includes temporal foundation models\, data
  streams\, and explainable temporal analysis. Climate\, health\, and ener
 gy are examples of applications rather than separate defining topic assig
 nments.\nAdditional topics: Deep Representation Learning\nScope sources (
 2026): https://ecml-aaltd.github.io/aaltd2026/\nScope last checked: 2026-
 10-07
URL:https://ecml-aaltd.github.io/aaltd2026/dates.html
